^["intent"]{
 ~#goal: "An agent that lands in the caches finds one root, one extension door, and one gate command, and can add a surface without reading the history of the cut. What is true now lives in the tree; what was true on a day lives in the journal. Surfaces spend their characters on claims, not on paths, receipts, and repeated card fields."
 ~#taste: "indexability and thrift: one signal per wire, address by anchor, derive what can be derived"
}

